Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.70,0:00:05.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,132)\fad(180,220)}“Accepting PRs from
Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.70,0:00:05.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,196)\fad(180,220)}strangers is coming to
Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.70,0:00:05.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,260)\fad(180,220)}an end”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,My hot take is that the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.11,0:00:04.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,open source
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.13,0:00:04.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,contributions are coming
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.81,0:00:05.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.27,0:00:05.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,We're going to get to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.69,0:00:07.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,the point where people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.61,0:00:08.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,stop accepting open
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.89,0:00:09.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,source contributions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.91,0:00:11.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,which I think is sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:13.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,With what I see in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:14.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,account takeovers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:15.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think even if there's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:17.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,a reputation system
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:17.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,those accounts are just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.74,0:00:18.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,going to get bought and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.38,0:00:19.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,sold on the secondary
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.80,0:00:21.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,markets. And then they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:22.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,just become a vector.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.89,0:00:24.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's going to be a way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:25.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,for you to showcase your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.29,0:00:27.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,code, what you're doing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:28.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,kind of like provide
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:29.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,value in that sense and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.87,0:00:30.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,as like a go to market
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.87,0:00:33.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,tool. But the days of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:34.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,accepting a PR from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.92,0:00:35.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,somebody who just loves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:36.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,your product.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.99,0:00:39.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,might sadly be coming to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.03,0:00:39.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,an end
